      "statusChangeID": "6296fe737348fd0b78392fcf",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "The lighthouses don't take up extra slots. We had initially added support for enough tracked devices for 11pt, this was limiting tracked devices to 11 total. For now we'll bump this up to 16 as is the old OpenVR max (you'll get 5 more slots).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
