      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: \nAfter testing it last night, issue still remain for me. \nLuckily I have a solution!🥂\nPlease follow the steps below:\n1) Open SteamVR\n2) Turn on 1 Base Station *Only*\n3) Turn on trackers & controllers\n4) Calibrate in SteamVR\n5) Turn on other Base Stations\n** Order sensitive! **",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
